# Partner Center credentials for scripts\submit-store.ps1.
#
# Copy this file to .env in this same folder and fill in the values. .env is gitignored;
# never commit it, and never paste these values into a chat or an issue. If the secret does
# leak, rotate it in Partner Center under Account settings > User management.
#
# Getting the values (one-time setup):
#   1. In Partner Center, associate the account with your Microsoft Entra directory.
#   2. Account settings > User management > Microsoft Entra applications: add the application
#      that represents this script and give it the Manager role. If the form asks for a Reply URL
#      and App ID URI, any valid URL unique within the directory will do - this flow never
#      redirects, so nothing resolves them. https://localhost/caffeinepro-store-submission works.
#   3. Open the application to copy the Tenant ID and Client ID.
#   4. Add a new key/client secret and copy it - it is shown only once.
#
# Quote any value containing spaces or a "#".

PARTNER_TENANT_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PARTNER_CLIENT_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PARTNER_CLIENT_SECRET=
